        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>void game()</strong> is a minimalist puzzle game about Death, its many faces, and its inevitable counterpart: Life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face 7 text-based puzzles with lite-ARG (Alternate Reality Game) elements. This means the solutions are not always within the game, but are intertwined with real-world information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle requires you to find Keys (letters) and combine them to form a Secret (a string of letters). Input the correct Secret to proceed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete all 7 puzzles, and you will receive a reward, one whose true value is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck, and have fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FEATURES:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lite-ARG elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist interface and art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay time: 20 minutes to 1 week, depends on you</p></li></ul>",
